  "description": "Hwa-Yeon meets his favorite idol Queen at his regular bar. He gets really nervous and drinks a lot of alcohol, quickly getting drunk and passing out. When he comes to, he's in a hotel room. Queen says she brought Hwa-Yeon to a nearby hotel after he collapsed, but the door won't open. he's checking things out when the TV suddenly turns on. \n\n*You have to complete the mission to leave this room.*\n\nMe having sex with Queen, and with the idol I've been secretly in love with...?\n\n(Source: Ridibooks, translated)",
